WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.580
Amazon Buy Shipping is a tool available to sellers who handle fulfillment of their own products.

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:11.511
This is called Fulfilled by Merchant or FBM.

00:00:11.511 --> 00:00:18.790
In this video, we will walk you through how to access Amazon Buy Shipping from the Manage Orders

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:19.254
Dashboard.

00:00:19.254 --> 00:00:26.271
However, you can also access Amazon Buy Shipping using Veeqo, our Shipping API connected to your

00:00:26.271 --> 00:00:29.840
order management software or other multi-channel integrators.

00:00:29.840 --> 00:00:35.265
To access the Manage Orders Dashboard, hover over the Orders tab in

00:00:35.265 --> 00:00:39.119
the Seller Central main menu, then select Manage Orders.

00:00:39.119 --> 00:00:42.313
Navigate to the Unshipped tab, then choose

00:00:42.313 --> 00:00:45.678
the order you'd like to ship and select Buy Shipping.

00:00:45.678 --> 00:00:47.764
Next, review the order details and

00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:49.786
make sure everything looks correct.

00:00:49.786 --> 00:00:52.616
Then, enter your product's packaging dimensions and

00:00:52.616 --> 00:00:56.114
weight and select the shipping service you'd like to use.

00:00:56.114 --> 00:00:58.176
You will see badges that indicate

00:00:58.176 --> 00:01:00.999
either claims protected or OTDR protected.

00:01:00.999 --> 00:01:03.973
These indicate shipping services that have

00:01:03.973 --> 00:01:07.167
a higher likelihood of arriving on time.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:10.580
When you choose shipping services with these badges,

00:01:10.580 --> 00:01:16.252
Amazon will provide refunds on A to Z claims related to delivery issues and protection

00:01:16.252 --> 00:01:21.756
from late deliveries as long as you have shipping settings automation and automated handling

00:01:21.756 --> 00:01:22.615
time enabled.

00:01:22.615 --> 00:01:28.713
To set this up in Seller Central, hover over Settings in the top right corner

00:01:28.713 --> 00:01:30.260
and select Shipping Settings.

00:01:30.260 --> 00:01:34.468
Go to the Shipping Templates tab and select Edit Template to

00:01:34.468 --> 00:01:36.355
turn on Shipping Setting Automation.

00:01:36.355 --> 00:01:40.300
Then go to the General Shipping Settings tab to enable

00:01:40.300 --> 00:01:41.560
automated handling time.

00:01:41.560 --> 00:01:45.340
Automated handling time is only required for Standard Orders.

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:50.921
While Seller-fulfilled Prime and Premium Shipping Orders simply need to be shipped

00:01:50.921 --> 00:01:51.780
on time.

00:01:51.780 --> 00:01:54.315
To submit, click the Buy Shipping button.

00:01:54.315 --> 00:01:56.849
On the next page, select Print Label

00:01:56.849 --> 00:01:58.660
to print your shipping label.

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:01.908
Amazon Buy Shipping will remember your product details

00:02:01.908 --> 00:02:06.780
for this ASIN, making it faster to purchase shipping labels next time.

00:02:06.780 --> 00:02:08.136
It will also remember

00:02:08.136 --> 00:02:11.864
the shipping service you chose for this product in this region.

00:02:11.864 --> 00:02:14.220
This will be used to set more

00:02:14.220 --> 00:02:19.220
accurate delivery dates on future orders of the same product going to the same region.

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:25.220
To purchase shipping labels in Bulk, return to the Unshipped tab on the Manage Orders page.

00:02:25.220 --> 00:02:31.057
You can select all Unshipped Orders by clicking the checkbox in the upper left hand corner

00:02:31.057 --> 00:02:34.340
or choose up to 100 orders one by one.

00:02:34.340 --> 00:02:37.850
Once you have made your selections, click Buy Shipping

00:02:37.850 --> 00:02:38.630
in Bulk.

00:02:38.630 --> 00:02:42.140
Update the weight and packaging information for each order.

00:02:42.140 --> 00:02:43.232
Next, verify the

00:02:43.232 --> 00:02:45.780
shipping service that will ship your order.

00:02:45.780 --> 00:02:49.416
To choose a different one, click Change under

00:02:49.416 --> 00:02:50.780
Selected Shipping Service.

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:54.460
Check the declared value of the order and the delivery confirmation

00:02:54.460 --> 00:02:58.140
to be notified when the order was delivered or signed for.

00:02:58.140 --> 00:03:00.471
At the bottom of the page,

00:03:00.471 --> 00:03:03.580
input your ship from location and ship date.

00:03:03.580 --> 00:03:05.980
Then choose how you would like your labels

00:03:05.980 --> 00:03:06.580
to print.

00:03:06.580 --> 00:03:11.980
Click Buy Shipping to submit and generate a printable PDF with all your labels.

00:03:11.980 --> 00:03:17.100
Remember to save the PDF containing your labels in case you need to reprint.

00:03:17.100 --> 00:03:18.420
Visit the Use

00:03:18.420 --> 00:03:21.940
Buy Shipping Services Help page for additional guidance.
